[
  {
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 20.44,
    "text": "Take a moment to arrive."
  },
  {
    "start": 30.0,
    "end": 52.52,
    "text": "This is a space designed for settling, for easing, for allowing the nervous system to return"
  },
  {
    "start": 52.52,
    "end": 59.7,
    "text": "To balance."
  },
  {
    "start": 59.7,
    "end": 66.84,
    "text": "There is nothing required of you here."
  },
  {
    "start": 66.84,
    "end": 78.3,
    "text": "Simply let yourself be supported."
  },
  {
    "start": 78.3,
    "end": 88.58,
    "text": "Find a comfortable position, seated or lying down."
  },
  {
    "start": 88.58,
    "end": 98.36,
    "text": "Allow your eyes to close."
  },
  {
    "start": 98.36,
    "end": 115.86,
    "text": "Take a slow and deep breath in through your nose and release it gently through your mouth."
  },
  {
    "start": 115.86,
    "end": 127.48,
    "text": "Let the body know it can rest."
  },
  {
    "start": 127.48,
    "end": 133.14,
    "text": "Take another slow breath in."
  },
  {
    "start": 133.14,
    "end": 145.42,
    "text": "As you exhale, notice the weight of the body being supported."
  },
  {
    "start": 145.42,
    "end": 157.22,
    "text": "The surface beneath you, holding you steadily."
  },
  {
    "start": 157.22,
    "end": 170.58,
    "text": "With each breath, the body begins to recognize safety."
  },
  {
    "start": 170.58,
    "end": 181.9,
    "text": "Your presence deepens naturally."
  },
  {
    "start": 181.9,
    "end": 186.86,
    "text": "Bring your attention to the top of the head."
  },
  {
    "start": 198.14,
    "end": 199.86,
    "text": "Allow it to soften."
  },
  {
    "start": 199.86,
    "end": 222.14,
    "text": "Let warmth spread gently."
  },
  {
    "start": 230.14,
    "end": 239.42,
    "text": "Down through the face."
  },
  {
    "start": 239.42,
    "end": 240.42,
    "text": "Down the eyes."
  },
  {
    "start": 240.42,
    "end": 240.42,
    "text": "Through the jaw."
  },
  {
    "start": 240.42,
    "end": 249.7,
    "text": "The muscles of the face can rest."
  },
  {
    "start": 249.7,
    "end": 250.7,
    "text": "Awareness moves down through the neck."
  },
  {
    "start": 288.58,
    "end": 299.72,
    "text": "Across the shoulders."
  },
  {
    "start": 299.72,
    "end": 312.12,
    "text": "Notice how much they have been carrying."
  },
  {
    "start": 312.12,
    "end": 325.74,
    "text": "Allow them to settle."
  },
  {
    "start": 325.74,
    "end": 339.78,
    "text": "The chest softens."
  },
  {
    "start": 339.78,
    "end": 366.74,
    "text": "Breathing becomes smoother, easier."
  },
  {
    "start": 366.74,
    "end": 382.46,
    "text": "Bringing awareness into the center of the body."
  },
  {
    "start": 382.46,
    "end": 393.88,
    "text": "The stomach."
  },
  {
    "start": 393.88,
    "end": 400.18,
    "text": "The space behind the ribs."
  },
  {
    "start": 400.18,
    "end": 417.9,
    "text": "Imagine warmth moving through this space."
  },
  {
    "start": 417.9,
    "end": 438.58,
    "text": "A sense of steadiness and deep internal support."
  },
  {
    "start": 438.58,
    "end": 443.3,
    "text": "The space continues downward."
  },
  {
    "start": 443.3,
    "end": 453.0,
    "text": "Through the hips."
  },
  {
    "start": 453.0,
    "end": 469.44,
    "text": "The legs."
  },
  {
    "start": 469.44,
    "end": 470.72,
    "text": "All the way into the feet."
  },
  {
    "start": 470.72,
    "end": 486.4,
    "text": "Feel the body fully connected to what is supporting it."
  },
  {
    "start": 486.4,
    "end": 498.12,
    "text": "The body fully connected to the body."
  },
  {
    "start": 525.56,
    "end": 536.56,
    "text": "Now bring awareness to the rhythm of your breath."
  },
  {
    "start": 536.56,
    "end": 543.94,
    "text": "The body fully connected to the body fully connected to the body."
  },
  {
    "start": 557.66,
    "end": 573.2,
    "text": "With each breath, signals of calm are sent through the body."
  },
  {
    "start": 573.2,
    "end": 585.04,
    "text": "Muscles respond."
  },
  {
    "start": 585.04,
    "end": 589.44,
    "text": "The heart settles."
  },
  {
    "start": 589.44,
    "end": 604.58,
    "text": "The system begins to recalibrate."
  },
  {
    "start": 604.58,
    "end": 612.52,
    "text": "Imagine a gentle field of calm surrounding you."
  },
  {
    "start": 612.52,
    "end": 632.48,
    "text": "This field supports you and regulates your body and mind."
  },
  {
    "start": 632.48,
    "end": 633.48,
    "text": "The body fully connected to the body."
  },
  {
    "start": 633.48,
    "end": 633.48,
    "text": "It supports balance."
  },
  {
    "start": 635.48,
    "end": 639.48,
    "text": "It supports recovery."
  },
  {
    "start": 653.48,
    "end": 653.48,
    "text": "Your body knows how to respond within this field."
  },
  {
    "start": 658.48,
    "end": 665.48,
    "text": "Allow yourself to repeat the following affirmations."
  },
  {
    "start": 665.48,
    "end": 666.48,
    "text": "The following affirmations."
  },
  {
    "start": 720.48,
    "end": 721.48,
    "text": "Www."
  },
  {
    "start": 736.48,
    "end": 736.48,
    "text": "It means."
  },
  {
    "start": 736.48,
    "end": 757.48,
    "text": "I am powerful."
  },
  {
    "start": 757.48,
    "end": 764.48,
    "text": "Remain here for a few moments."
  },
  {
    "start": 764.48,
    "end": 765.48,
    "text": "Resting."
  },
  {
    "start": 765.48,
    "end": 766.48,
    "text": "Allowing."
  },
  {
    "start": 766.48,
    "end": 792.48,
    "text": "Letting the nervous system integrate this state."
  },
  {
    "start": 792.48,
    "end": 817.48,
    "text": "Begin to gently bring awareness back into your body."
  },
  {
    "start": 817.48,
    "end": 829.48,
    "text": "Notice the breath again."
  },
  {
    "start": 829.48,
    "end": 842.48,
    "text": "The weight of the body."
  },
  {
    "start": 842.48,
    "end": 843.48,
    "text": "The support beneath you."
  },
  {
    "start": 843.48,
    "end": 843.48,
    "text": "Take one full nourishing breath in."
  },
  {
    "start": 843.48,
    "end": 843.48,
    "text": "And release it slowly."
  },
  {
    "start": 844.48,
    "end": 845.48,
    "text": "Slowly."
  },
  {
    "start": 859.48,
    "end": 860.48,
    "text": "Know that you can always return to this place within your mind."
  }
]
